{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:4bbdc487bfc4bf7e","name":"Order of Shasa Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-4bbdc487bfc4bf7e","title":"Order of Shasa Talent Tree","revision":25727,"timestamp":"2024-12-09T04:29:56Z","sha256":"742dd81cb0220c778b9d8f505638b637e43980c49e95f9eac0711bf68972fa7c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=25727","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Order%20of%20Shasa%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-4bbdc487bfc4bf7e","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Order of Shasa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Order_of_Shasa","referenceId":"reference:e706dc9110370d25"}," is still developing training techniques and abilities, taking most of their influence from Manaan's oceans. Only Force-users that are part of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Order of Shasa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Order_of_Shasa","referenceId":"reference:e706dc9110370d25"}," may select ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," from this tree.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Deception Awareness"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Realizing how devastating the consequences would have been if ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," had successfully deceived her and her companions during the Jedi Civil War, Shasa has developed a technique for using ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to detect deceptions. You gain +5 to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," against uses of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," skill.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Additionally, you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check instead of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sense Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sense_Deception"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sense Influence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sense_Influence"},". You are considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," for the purposes of using this Talent. If you are entitled to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check reroll, you may reroll your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check instead (subject to the same circumstances and limitations).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Greater Weapon Focus (Fira)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Focus (Fira)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Focus_(Fira)"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You have mastered the chosen weapon of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Order of Shasa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Order_of_Shasa","referenceId":"reference:e706dc9110370d25"},". You gain a +1 bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," rolls with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fira"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fira","referenceId":"reference:4ec91cc40800019d"},". This bonus stacks with the bonus granted by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Focus (Fira)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Focus_(Fira)"}," feat.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Progenitor's Call"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You have learned to sense the call of your ancestors and wield it through ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". Once per encounter, you can telepathically disrupt an opponent by making a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check against the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},". If you succeed, the target is confused by the call, moving -1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent"}," step down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," and losing its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," on its next turn.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A creature can only be affected by this power once per encounter, and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent Condition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent_Condition"}," can be removed with a DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," check or by resting for 8 hours. This is a Mind-Affecting effect.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Waveform"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Taking cues from Manaan's oceans, you know how to emulate wave action using ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", when you use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Telekinetic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Telekinetic"}," Force Power (that is, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," with the [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Telekinetic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Telekinetic"}]},"] descriptor), you manipulate the particles of the environment around you to add to the force of the impact, allowing you to add your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," modifier to any damage dealt (minimum +1).\n"]},"\n"]}}
